  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=32><style=coinColor><b>LIGHTNING BONUS</b></style></size>\n<size=20><align=left>-
      Any 3 or more Scatters initiates the Lightning \n  Bonus.\n<size=5>\n</size>-
      In Lightning Bonus, initial Scatters get locked,\n  while the reels re-spin
      3 times.\n<size=5>\n</size>- Any new Scatter symbol awards 1 more\n   re-spin.\n<size=5>\n</size>-
      When re-spin ends, begin the Scatter Bonus.\n<size=5>\n</size>- Each Scatter
      represents a 1 line game in the\n  respective Scatter Bonus.\n "
