  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Mega Money Lightning
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>How to Play</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "<size=22>- Player can play Keno Mega Money once bet is set up.\n- Before
      playing Keno Mega Money, one chooses 2-10 numbers from 1 to 80.  \n- Once clicking
      the \"PLAY\" button, 20 balls with random numbers from 1 to 80 are drawn. \n-
      If the numbers of dropped balls match with the numbers player chose, then player
      wins.\n- Depending on the number of matching numbers, win pay varies. </size>"
