  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_TITLE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32>MEGA MONEY LIGHTNING</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "<size=18>- Before balls with numbers are drawn, 5 random\n    numbers
      from 1 to 80, except the numbers player\n    already chose, are automatically
      and randomly\n    selected. \n\n- After 20 balls with random numbers are dropped,
      \n    if ALL numbers of Special Spots match with the \v    numbers of dropped
      balls, then Mega Money \n    Lightning Bonus Game is triggered.</size>"
